horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">?/Stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">?/Stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.96.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unobtainale unless trading</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>This tree was part of the 2025 <a href=\"/wiki/My_Island_Collab\" title=\"My Island Collab\">My Island Collab</a>, it resembles the normal trees of said game. It was added alongside 2 other trees: <a href=\"/wiki/Tree_of_Doom\" title=\"Tree of Doom\">Tree of Doom</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Flower_of_Friendship\" title=\"Flower of Friendship\">Flower of Friendship</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Obtaining_.28after_the_event.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining_(after_the_event)\">Obtaining (after the event)</span></h2>\n<p>As of the end of the collab, the tree has become unobtainable via regular means unless trading with other players. Although in the 1.96.0 changelog said the tree's could come back in the future, but nothing more has been said about the matter.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Obtaining_.28during_the_event.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining_(during_the_event)\">Obtaining (during the event)</span></h2>\n<p>The tree will spawn in the main biome (otherwise known as <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay</a>) replacing most oak trees.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 556px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/12/7748923638_9938675423_1766589991528.png/revision/latest?cb=20251224155250\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"7748923638 9938675423 1766589991528\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/12/7748923638_9938675423_1766589991528.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/556?cb=20251224155250\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"556\" height=\"313\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"7748923638 9938675423 1766589991528.png\" data-image-key=\"7748923638_9938675423_1766589991528.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:7748923638_9938675423_1766589991528.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 567px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0d/Plank.png/revision/latest?cb=20251224155359\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\" &#9;\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0d/Plank.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/567?cb=20251224155359\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"567\" height=\"319\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Plank.png\" data-image-key=\"Plank.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<fig